<title>USA: Krantor resumes trading on Nasdaq.</title>
<headline>Krantor resumes trading on Nasdaq.</headline>
<dateline>DEER PARK, N.Y. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Krantor Corp said on Friday its shares have resumed trading on the NASDAQ Small Cap Market under the symbol &quot;KRAN&quot;.</p>
<p>Krantor, a food broker, said earlier in May that its shareholders approved a one-for-25 reverse stock split.</p>
<p>Its previous symbol was &quot;KRAND,&quot; the company said.</p>
